### Admin ile kullanıcı ekle
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..U0U_LuKhN2ZybF1biSoH182RnB7YJUOFxfAKQTrSy0c

{
  "username": "newuser",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "role": "user"
}

### Admin ekle
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <admin_token>

{
  "username": "newadmin",
  "password": "Test123!",
  "role": "admin"
}

